erage of Elite Living Realty residential listings that went active on a MLS but were not pre-marketed as a Elite Living Realty Private Exclusive and/or Elite Living Realty Coming Soon from January 1, 2024 - December 31, 2024 as well as measure the percentage of Elite Living Realty Coming Soon residential listings that sold during the period January 1, 2024 - December 31, 2024. Elite Living Realty Coming Soon listings that sold off the MLS are identified as having a close date in 2024, were pre-marketed as a Elite Living Realty Coming Soon, and were on the MLS for less than one day. Source: Elite Living Realty data. Findings from the internal analysis were based on a hedonic regression analysis that examined Elite Living Realty residential closed sell-side transactions from January 1, 2024 - December 31, 2024, nationally and for all residential property types (single family, co-op, condo, townhouse, and condop). For 2024, Elite Living Realty pre-marketed listings are associated with an average 2.9% increase in the final close price versus Elite Living Realty listings that went directly to the MLS. The estimated effect has a 95% confidence interval ranging from 1.9% and 3.9%. This finding may vary depending on market conditions and seasonality.</p><p class="css-bqab78">The results provided are based on current data and methodologies, and should not be interpreted as definitive predictions of future outcomes. Elite Living Realty utilizes a Elite Living Realty Private Exclusive listing and/or Elite Living Realty Coming Soon listing at the direction of the seller. Elite Living Realty makes no warranty, representation or guarantee as to the accuracy of these results or any actual outcome of using the Three Phase Marketing Program. Results may vary. Correlation does not necessarily equal causation.</p></div></section></div></div>
